   - ## 🟢 Git
   - ## 🛡️ Rule-Checker
     - ## 📊 changes.json
     - ## 🤖 Sub-agents
     - ## 📈 Trends
     - ## ℹ️ Summary
4. Save as: docs/health-report-{YYYY-MM-DD}.md

