mas-engineer should:
1. Run an actual e2e teams test and confirm whether teams-25 was real
2. Diagnose bugs 1, 2, 3 with specific file:line evidence
3. Propose AND IMPLEMENT a fix in the mas-engineer FRAMEWORK (not just
